# Every database this course uses lives in Databases/ (MySQL provisioning scripts
# and project-day SQLite files alike). Datasets are committed directly when small
# enough so students don't need a separate download step; only exclude a specific
# oversized file here when it actually can't fit in git — decide per-dataset when
# that day is built, don't blanket-exclude the extension.

# Day 06's SQLite file is generated by running day06_python_sqlite.ipynb
# (migrated live from MySQL) — regenerate rather than commit, same reasoning
# as never committing .env.
Databases/rawaj.sqlite

# European Soccer's dataset is ~299 MB — over GitHub's 100 MB limit. Download it
# per Day 08/day08_reading.html's dataset section instead.
Databases/soccer.sqlite
